WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.433 --> 00:00:09.572
&gt;&gt; Greg: TIME FOR...

00:00:09.573 --> 00:00:13.776
WELCOME TO -- IT'S JUST TOO

00:00:13.777 --> 00:00:14.377
EASY.

00:00:14.378 --> 00:00:15.979
A STORY TOO EASY TO RIDICULE,

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:18.381
MAKING IT TOO HARD TO IGNORE.

00:00:18.382 --> 00:00:22.118
PETE DAVIDSON, THE NICE KID FROM

00:00:22.119 --> 00:00:23.386
"SATURDAY NIGHT LIVE," HE GOT A

00:00:23.387 --> 00:00:24.554
TATTOO OF HILLARY ON HIS ARM.

00:00:24.555 --> 00:00:25.555
ONE'S FRIENDS ASKED WHY IS THAT

00:00:25.556 --> 00:00:31.294
IS BECAUSE HILLARY WAS A BADASS.

00:00:31.295 --> 00:00:35.531
NOW HE HAS SOMETHING IN COMMON

00:00:35.532 --> 00:00:35.965
WITH HILLARY.

00:00:35.966 --> 00:00:39.736
THEY BOTH HAVE A ASS ON THEIR

00:00:39.737 --> 00:00:40.336
ARM.

00:00:40.337 --> 00:00:41.371
HERS IS NAMED BILL.

00:00:41.372 --> 00:00:43.106
I COULD SAY THIS IS THE FUNNIEST

00:00:43.107 --> 00:00:44.474
THING PETER HAS EVER DONE BUT

00:00:44.475 --> 00:00:45.375
THAT'S TOO EASY.

00:00:45.376 --> 00:00:46.743
I COULD SAY IT'S THE FUNNIEST

00:00:46.744 --> 00:00:48.177
THING TO COME OUT OF "SNL" BUT

00:00:48.178 --> 00:00:50.346
THAT'S TOO EASY.

00:00:53.584 --> 00:00:54.150
HILLARY.

00:00:56.186 --> 00:00:58.855
HILLARY WHEN THERE IS SO MANY

00:00:58.856 --> 00:01:00.790
OTHER MORE PREFERABLE OPTIONS.

00:01:00.791 --> 00:01:01.724
LIKE ALL GORGEOUS DOLPHIN.

00:01:01.725 --> 00:01:03.793
LOOK AT THAT OR MAY BE A

00:01:03.794 --> 00:01:04.794
DELIGHTFUL UNICORN.

00:01:04.795 --> 00:01:06.429
SO SPECIAL.

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:07.797
MORE WHY NOT ME?

00:01:07.798 --> 00:01:08.765
LOOK AT THAT.

00:01:08.766 --> 00:01:09.232
IT'S BEAUTIFUL.

00:01:09.233 --> 00:01:12.669
EVERYONE SHOULD HAVE ME ON THEIR

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:14.337
BODY.

00:01:14.338 --> 00:01:14.737
TATTOOWISE.

00:01:14.738 --> 00:01:16.139
WE GET IT.

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:17.573
YOU CARE.

00:01:17.574 --> 00:01:19.776
YOU ARE MORALLY SUPERIOR BUT

00:01:19.777 --> 00:01:20.777
WOEFULLY TRANSPARENT.

00:01:20.778 --> 00:01:22.345
TATTOOS ILLUSTRATE DECISIONS

00:01:22.346 --> 00:01:23.212
BASED ON FEELINGS AND WITH

00:01:23.213 --> 00:01:26.549
SOMETHING YOU REALLY REGRET.

00:01:26.550 --> 00:01:28.751
LIKE CHOOSING HILLARY AS YOUR

00:01:28.752 --> 00:01:29.752
CANDIDATE.

00:01:33.924 --> 00:01:35.858
I WANTED TO DO THIS STORY SO WE

00:01:35.859 --> 00:01:36.926
COULD TALK ABOUT TATTOOS.

00:01:36.927 --> 00:01:38.962
I WILL START WITH YOU, DANA.

00:01:38.963 --> 00:01:41.230
IF YOU GET A TATTOO, WHAT WOULD

00:01:41.231 --> 00:01:41.531
IT BE?

00:01:41.532 --> 00:01:44.200
&gt;&gt; Dana: WELL, I THINK, YOU

00:01:44.201 --> 00:01:46.536
KNOW, I AM NOT FOR TATTOOS.

00:01:46.537 --> 00:01:47.537
THIS IS PRETEND.

00:01:47.538 --> 00:01:50.239
I WOULD GO WITH MY MAIN MAN,

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:50.573
JASPER.

00:01:50.574 --> 00:01:55.979
&gt;&gt; Greg: THERE YOU GO.

00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:57.947
A VERY HAIRY ARM.

00:01:57.948 --> 00:02:00.316
&gt;&gt; Dana: ANOTHER REASON I AM

00:02:00.317 --> 00:02:01.184
TERRIFIED OF THE TATTOO.

00:02:01.185 --> 00:02:02.418
DOESN'T IT HURT TERRIBLY?

00:02:02.419 --> 00:02:04.187
&gt;&gt; Greg: IT DOES.

00:02:04.188 --> 00:02:05.788
THAT'S WHY YOU GET DRUNK.

00:02:05.789 --> 00:02:08.758
TONS OF SHOTS, A COUPLE PAIN

00:02:10.594 --> 00:02:12.562
YOUR TATTOO, IF YOU COULD.

00:02:12.563 --> 00:02:14.564
&gt;&gt; Kimberly: I HAVE NO TATTOOS

00:02:14.565 --> 00:02:15.431
ON MY BODY.

00:02:15.432 --> 00:02:17.567
LIKE DANA, I DON'T DO THEM.

00:02:17.568 --> 00:02:18.568
NOT GOING TO HAPPEN.

00:02:18.569 --> 00:02:22.338
HOWEVER, TO PLAY ALONG, OR

00:02:22.339 --> 00:02:27.610
ROLE-PLAY, AS THEY SAY.

00:02:27.611 --> 00:02:32.749
I WOULD GET RONAN, MY MUNCHKIN.

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:37.520
WHAT A CUTIE.

00:02:37.521 --> 00:02:44.994
&gt;&gt; Greg: ALL RIGHT, JESSE.

00:02:44.995 --> 00:02:46.562
&gt;&gt; Kimberly: THAT WOULD BE ON

00:02:46.563 --> 00:02:46.963
MY SHOULDER.

00:02:51.235 --> 00:02:52.935
&gt;&gt; Greg: JESSE, I AM DYING TO

00:02:52.936 --> 00:02:53.369
KNOW.

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:54.470
&gt;&gt; Jesse: I PUT A LOT OF

00:02:54.471 --> 00:02:57.407
THOUGHT IN THIS AND I CAME UP

00:02:57.408 --> 00:03:00.376
WITH DR. SEBASTIAN GORKA.

00:03:00.377 --> 00:03:02.545
I THINK HE WOULD LOOK GREAT ON

00:03:02.546 --> 00:03:06.549
ANY APPENDAGE.

00:03:06.550 --> 00:03:07.517
THERE IS SOMETHING TERRIFYING

00:03:07.518 --> 00:03:09.152
ABOUT HIM BUT REALLY WHOLESOME

00:03:09.153 --> 00:03:09.952
ALSO.

00:03:09.953 --> 00:03:11.187
HE IS THE MOST FASCINATING MAN,

00:03:11.188 --> 00:03:14.757
THAT COMMERCIAL.

00:03:14.758 --> 00:03:15.458
FASCINATING ON MANY LEVELS.

00:03:15.459 --> 00:03:20.730
I THINK IT WOULD BE A NICE

00:03:20.731 --> 00:03:21.330
CONVERSATION PIECE.

00:03:21.331 --> 00:03:22.799
WOMEN WOULD LIKE IT.

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:23.800
MEN WOULD LIKE IT.

00:03:27.137 --> 00:03:27.437
CRIME?

00:03:27.438 --> 00:03:31.174
&gt;&gt; Kimberly: EVEN BETTER.

00:03:35.412 --> 00:03:38.114
&gt;&gt; Jesse: IF HE IS GOING --

00:03:38.115 --> 00:03:39.749
&gt;&gt; Juan: IF HE IS GOING TO GET

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:44.353
HILLARY, I'VE GOT TO GET A

00:03:44.354 --> 00:03:45.354
TRIPLE.

00:03:45.355 --> 00:03:46.355
EVERYBODY.

00:03:46.356 --> 00:03:48.324
HANNITY, LAURA INGRAHAM,

00:03:48.325 --> 00:03:49.158
JEANINE PIRRO.

00:03:49.159 --> 00:03:50.760
I REALLY WANT THE GIRLS ON

00:03:50.761 --> 00:03:52.261
EITHER SIDE OF HANNITY BECAUSE I

00:03:52.262 --> 00:03:55.565
WANTED A PROPAGANDA SPECIAL.

00:03:55.566 --> 00:03:57.767
&gt;&gt; Jesse: THAT IS FAIR AND

00:03:57.768 --> 00:03:58.134
BALANCED.

00:03:58.135 --> 00:03:59.535
&gt;&gt; Kimberly: I THINK IT'S

00:03:59.536 --> 00:03:59.936
ATTRACTIVE.

00:03:59.937 --> 00:04:01.571
&gt;&gt; Greg: I GOT A TATTOO.

00:04:01.572 --> 00:04:02.538
THIS IS ON ME.

00:04:02.539 --> 00:04:07.143
I GOT ATTACHED TO OF TATTOO FROM

00:04:07.144 --> 00:04:07.810
"FANTASY ISLAND" HANGING OUT

00:04:07.811 --> 00:04:11.414
WITH THE RUSSIAN POP STAR DUO

00:04:11.415 --> 00:04:12.181
TATTOO.

00:04:12.182 --> 00:04:14.383
THEY ALL HAVE THEIR HANDS UP.

00:04:14.384 --> 00:04:17.220
ISN'T IT PLEASANT?

00:04:17.221 --> 00:04:22.158
IT IS INTERESTING.

00:04:25.929 --> 00:04:27.330
&gt;&gt; Greg: SHAWN O'ROURKE.

00:04:27.331 --> 00:04:31.534
I GAVE HIM AN UNUSUAL MISSION.

00:04:31.535 --> 00:04:32.735
ROGER STONE HAS A TATTOO.

